<%# The hoojah you were viewing is gone — navigate the browser away from its show
    page. Issue #38: `@destination` is the page you came from BEFORE opening this
    hoojah (a validated same-origin path threaded through `return_to`), or the feed
    (`root_path`) when that's absent/unsafe. `visit` is a custom StreamAction
    (app/javascript/application.js) that calls Turbo.visit, so this stays a SPA
    navigation instead of a full reload. %>
<%= turbo_stream_action_tag "visit", url: @destination %>
